           "title": "Determining the signal frequency by Lissajous curves and beats observation",
           "url": "https://pm.szczecin.pl/uploads/imfich/zaklad-fizyki/Determining_the_signal_frequency_by_Lissajous_curves_and_beats_observation_01.pdf",
           "sourceType": "",
